{"id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:deformation-retraction","title":"def:deformation-retraction","path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.md","line":1,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex#def:deformation-retraction","uses":["[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:retraction]]","[[references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:homotopy-rel-a]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex","label":"def:deformation-retraction","line":11,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Deformation retraction]\n\\label{def:deformation-retraction}\n\n\\uses{def:retraction, def:homotopy-rel-a}\n\n\\group{Homotopy Theory}\n\n\n\nA \\textbf{deformation retraction} of a space $X$ onto a subspace $A$ is a family\n$f_t:X\\to X$ for $t\\in I=[0,1]$ such that $f_0=\\one$, $f_1(X)=A$, and\n$f_t|_A=\\one$ for every $t$, with $(x,t)\\mapsto f_t(x)$ continuous.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Deformation retraction] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a6465666f726d6174696f6e2d72657472616374696f6e\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter0%23def%3Aretraction\">↗ def:retraction</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FHatcher%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter0%23def%3Ahomotopy-rel-a\">↗ def:homotopy-rel-a</a> <p></p>\\group Homotopy Theory <p></p>A <strong>deformation retraction</strong> of a space <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X$\">$X$</span> onto a subspace <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$A$\">$A$</span> is a family <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f_t:X\\to X$\">$f_t:X\\to X$</span> for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t\\in I=[0,1]$\">$t\\in I=[0,1]$</span> such that <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f_0=\\one $\">$f_0=\\one $</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f_1(X)=A$\">$f_1(X)=A$</span>, and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f_t|_A=\\one $\">$f_t|_A=\\one $</span> for every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t$\">$t$</span>, with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(x,t)\\mapsto f_t(x)$\">$(x,t)\\mapsto f_t(x)$</span> continuous. ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":null,"next":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:mapping-cylinder","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:retraction","title":"def:retraction","label":"def:retraction"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:homotopy-rel-a","title":"def:homotopy-rel-a","label":"def:homotopy-rel-a"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#prop:deformation-retract-homotopy-equivalence","title":"prop:deformation-retract-homotopy-equivalence","label":"prop:deformation-retract-homotopy-equivalence"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#lem:hep-cylinder-deformation-retract","title":"lem:hep-cylinder-deformation-retract","label":"lem:hep-cylinder-deformation-retract"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#prop:cw-pairs-have-hep","title":"prop:cw-pairs-have-hep","label":"prop:cw-pairs-have-hep"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter1#prop:retract-induces-injective-pi1","title":"prop:retract-induces-injective-pi1","label":"prop:retract-induces-injective-pi1"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:excision","title":"thm:excision","label":"thm:excision"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:good-pairs-absolute-homology","title":"prop:good-pairs-absolute-homology","label":"prop:good-pairs-absolute-homology"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:deformation-retraction","title":"def:deformation-retraction","tex":"\\begin{definition}[Deformation retraction]\n\\label{def:deformation-retraction}\n\n\\uses{def:retraction, def:homotopy-rel-a}\n\n\\group{Homotopy Theory}\n\n\n\nA \\textbf{deformation retraction} of a space $X$ onto a subspace $A$ is a family\n$f_t:X\\to X$ for $t\\in I=[0,1]$ such that $f_0=\\one$, $f_1(X)=A$, and\n$f_t|_A=\\one$ for every $t$, with $(x,t)\\mapsto f_t(x)$ continuous.\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:retraction","title":"def:retraction","description":""},{"node":"references/Hatcher/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter0#def:homotopy-rel-a","title":"def:homotopy-rel-a","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}